stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PRODUCTION
  PRODUCTION --> RESTRICTED: Corroborated deterministic rule or analyst
  PRODUCTION --> TERMINATED: TTL or identity suspension
  RESTRICTED --> DECOY_PENDING: Eligible external nontransactional session
  RESTRICTED --> TERMINATED: Operator or expiry
  DECOY_PENDING --> DECOY: Verified template and atomic pin
  DECOY_PENDING --> TERMINATED: Failure or stop
  DECOY --> TERMINATED: TTL, budget, failure or kill switch
  TERMINATED --> [*]
  note right of RESTRICTED: Missing readiness stays denied
  note right of DECOY: No DECOY to PRODUCTION transition
